      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-01-10T09:22:08Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "As you say, it\u0027s a preference thing.  More often than not the \u0027\\n\u0027 is omitted.\n\nMy views aren\u0027t strong enough to hold anyone to ransom on it however.",
      "parentUuid": "5385a62b_cea1f855",
      "revId": "965516abb209e4105b88bc2bf13dd37996ba1e7e",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
