      "writtenOn": "2023-01-16T10:54:58Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I thought more about this and I have a change of heart. Since there is no strict timeframe/deadline until a bugfix should be integrated into the android branches, I\u0027ll backport these 2 fixes once they are integrated into android*-lts. I\u0027ll track the status of a fix with some scripts so I won\u0027t spend too much time on tracking it.",
